   243	| instruction provenance | `[segment-address pc origin root-address path]` | the lowering (§5.3) |
   244	| macro declarations | `[[:source medium batch] index path]`: the definition at `path` of the batch's `index`-th tree is a macro definition (§8.5) | the frontend, consumed by the expander |
