   776	naming the same.
   777	
   778	### 7.6 The hot loop never queries
   779	
   780	The walker dispatches on `(nth node 0)` and reads slots by position; the
   781	semantic VM runs `(aget code pc)` over an image decoded once at load
   782	(`yin.vm.semantic.md` §3.1). Neither touches a relation, a ref, an address
   783	index, or a projection while stepping. Projection and query are load-time
   784	and tooling-time operations. This is the rule that keeps
   785	`yin.vm.semantic.md` §6's cost model intact under this design: queryability
   786	is paid once at load, or by whoever asks, never per step.
