   847	versioned with the execution contract stamp (UCF §7.3.3) because the
   848	effect a mnemonic raises is part of that contract. Extraction applies the
   849	table **before** any union with callable-profile effects, so the union is
   850	over one vocabulary. The table for contract `"v2"`:
