   853	|---|---|---|---|
   854	| `:stream/make` | `:stream-make` | `#{:stream/make}` | — |
   855	| `:stream/put` | `:stream-put` | `#{:stream/put}` | — |
   856	| `:stream/cursor` | `:stream-cursor` | `#{:stream/cursor}` | — |
   857	| `:stream/next` | `:stream-next` | `#{:stream/next}` | — |
   858	| `:stream/close` | `:stream-close` | `#{:stream/close}` | — |
